      ],
      "impact": "The ATO solenoid-valve driver (R10/T4/T5) is driven from a different GPIO than the reference design. Firmware that drives the intended pin (IO2) would leave the ATO fill valve inoperative, and IO7/SPI_MOSI is otherwise an SPI pin, so the ATO function behaves differently from the intended design.",
